  "description": "Elegant and bright 2 Bed apartment, beside Herbert Park.  With plenty of storage! \n\nA superb opportunity to acquire a 2 bed apartment in a highly sought-after development of The Cedars, Herbert Park, Dublin 4.\n\nThe apartment is aprox. 74sq meters of well-proportioned accommodation and enjoys a peaceful setting overlooking the landscaped communal grounds.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hall  with excellent storage, a bright and spacious living room, a separate fully fitted kitchen, two generous double bedrooms, with 1 ensuite and built in wardrobes, in both bedrooms! \n\nResidents of The Cedars benefit from an enviable location just moments from Herbert Park, while Ballsbridge, Donnybrook and Dublin city center are within easy reach.",
